{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "Thank you, Dr. Morgan. Here is my referral-screening checklist report. My current student-services file review has identified active no-contact orders involving two students — Nia and Omar. I confirmed these orders with the families this week. Any peer-mediation referrals involving either Nia or Omar must be screened out of the program, because mediation would bring those students into direct contact in violation of the no-contact orders. This screening requirement has not yet been added to the current draft of the operating plan, so I'm formally disclosing it now as a required plan change. Dr. Morgan, please record that the operating plan must include a referral-screening provision excluding any referrals involving Nia or Omar from peer mediation. That completes my referral-screening checklist report."}
